<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cambridge NeuroScience.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cambridge NeuroScience.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Cambridge NeuroScience Inc with an attractive rating and a 12-month price target of $22-$24, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- In early Nasdaq trade Cambridge shares rose 3/8 to 12-1/4.</p>
